# S5-07 schema-v20 MMU-gather page-walk exact replay (2026-11-17)

## Scope

Replay the two canonical Stage4A nonces with the schema-v20 read-only MMU-gather page-walk capture. Verify each runner stop and UART against its own schema-v18 canonical replay, then inspect the bounded gather phases and copy-destination page walks. This is diagnostic evidence; it does not change the strict comparator or S5-07 acceptance.

Implementation revision: `36a568d` (`feat: capture schema-v20 MMU gather page walks`). Canonical schema-v18 source artifacts: `work/stage5/s5-07-post-main-v18-baseline-exact-replay-20261117-a/run-{0001,0002}/`; see [the schema-v18 replay report](s5-07-post-main-schema-v18-exact-replay-20261117.log).

Release runner binary used for both runs: 12,982,320 bytes, SHA-256 `d5dceffff83b2731d5deee51cbdabf67785976dbb1a9f151b2252c76dee51338`.

